   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Create an address book using information for four friends or family members. The table should include their names, street addresses, phone numbers, and email addresses. Their street addresses should be separated into four columns: the street and house/apartment number, the city, the state, and the zip code. Use the formatting methods you have learned so far.\n",
